(text "Read at startup: open/open = 1; ADDR0 fitted = 2; ADDR1 fitted = 3; both fitted = 4.\nUSART1 requires PA11->PA9 and PA12->PA10 remapping. SPI1: PA1/PA2/PA6 AF0.\nI2C1 uses PB6/PB7 AF6. Keep all other GPIOs bonded to these pads in analog mode.\nUse internal HSI/PLL; do not enable LSE. Preserve PA13/PA14 for SWD." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "c4d249e9-87b1-4d04-822f-abf4719ab1c4")) (embedded_fonts no))
